                                    <Paragraph>
                                      <TextRuns>
                                        <TextRun>
                                          <Value>17.     Any export and/ or re-export to Russia is strictly prohibited. Any breach with this obligation will be considered material breach and may lead to termination of any purchase order (current or future) without any liability.</Value>
